{"id":"n67372-1-3","stage":0,"title":"역시 · 也","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67372-1-3-1","ko":"이 집 냉면 어때?","zh":"这家的冷面怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"집","meaning":"家，店","explanation":"집：家，店。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"7","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}},{"text":"냉면","meaning":"冷面","explanation":"냉면：冷面。","readings":[{"term":"냉면","audio":"/audio/0bd080fa0243c64881e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32777","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냉면","audio":"/audio/0bd080fa0243c64881e5.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，店","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"表示“销售商品的店铺”或“营业的店铺”。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"0bd080fa0243c648","term":"냉면","zh":"冷面","audio":"/audio/0bd080fa0243c64881e5.mp3","entryId":"32777","definition":"一种将面条用凉汤或辛奇汤汁泡着吃，或用辣椒酱拌着吃的食物。","pronunciation":["냉ː면"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/acaffadba89e3f3112cf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67372-1-3-2","ko":"저번에 설렁탕도 맛있더니 냉면도 역시 맛있네.","zh":"上次吃的牛骨汤就很美味，冷面果然也好吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저번에","meaning":"上次","explanation":"저번：上一次；-에 标记时间。","readings":[{"term":"저번","audio":"/audio/cfbadf011c981e92e9cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71227","senseId":"1","lemma":"저번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저번에","audio":"/audio/e5add28f76ad4e4a4fb2.mp3"}},{"text":"설렁탕도","meaning":"雪浓汤（韩式牛骨汤）也","explanation":"설렁탕：以牛骨、牛头肉等熬成的韩式汤；-도 表示“也”。","readings":[{"term":"설렁탕","audio":"/audio/b33a2dd389f9ea5aff1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44999","senseId":"1","lemma":"설렁탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설렁탕도","audio":"/audio/fa3a765ddb80f7d917a9.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있더니","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있더니","audio":"/audio/9cdd3f4811b2919a17a0.mp3"}},{"text":"냉면도","meaning":"冷面","explanation":"냉면：冷面；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"냉면","audio":"/audio/0bd080fa0243c64881e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32777","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냉면도","audio":"/audio/e1f048d1df80ae15fd6f.mp3"}},{"text":"역시","meaning":"果然也","explanation":"역시 在这里承接前面雪浓汤好吃的经验，表示冷面也同样好吃、符合预期。","readings":[{"term":"역시","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67372","senseId":"1","lemma":"역시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"역시","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있네.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","re